B.bbk=new A.n4("Hardy clans","Your levies fight 35% harder, and hills and forests never slow your attacks.")
B.bbl=new A.n4("The great levy","Every Mercian province musters 30% more levies.")
B.bbm=new A.n4("Sea kings","Longships cost a third less than other realms' ships and are built on any coast you hold, where your hosts also recruit.")
B.bbn=new A.n4("Mountain fastness","Your hosts and levies fight 30% harder defending Welsh land.")
B.bbo=new A.n4("Northern fury","Your hosts fight 15% harder when they attack.")
B.bbp=new A.n4("Danegeld","Demand gold from a realm you are at war with \u2014 if it fears you, it pays for peace. Your hosts live off the land, and ships carry them to any coast within reach.")
B.bbq=new A.n4("Burhs","Forts cost half, and every fort level musters far more local levies.")
