B.bbt=new A.ME(0)
B.bbu=new A.R("Peace:"," a realm at war with you makes peace when it is losing \u2014 weaker than you (on Hard, well beaten), and none of its homeland in your hands. Peace lasts 8 turns, and neither side may attack while it holds.")
B.bbv=new A.R(0,0)
B.bbw=new A.R(0,!0)
B.bby=new A.R("","Or be the last realm standing. If nobody has won by turn 100, the realm with the most prestige wins \u2014 it comes mostly from holding and taking land.")
B.bbz=new A.R("Alliance:"," a realm at peace with you that shares an enemy will ally for 12 turns, and your armies may cross each other's land.")
